  "task": "X41 h=4 centered norm-gate localization",
  "theorem": "Over characteristic-zero roots of unity, two unordered pairs with the same nonzero sum are equal: conjugating x+y=u+v=s gives x^-1+y^-1=u^-1+v^-1, hence s/(xy)=s/(uv), so xy=uv and the pairs have the same sum and product.  Therefore a finite-field nonzero pair-sum collision cannot be Phi_n-descended; by X30/X31 its sparse 2+2 word has p dividing Res(Phi_n,f).  The centered affine h=4 residue from X40 is consequently p-specific norm-gate mass at the pair-shell level.",
